-        {"stoplights":[{"label":"\(SAFETY_CAPTION_UNDER_TEST)",\
-        "tier":"\(tier)","reading":"\(reading)",\
-        "nextTier":\(nextTier),"progress":\(progress),\
-        "figureOffScale":\(figureOffScale)}]}
-        """
-}
